    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d98-a1">

                <pb facs="0168" n="134" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg134"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Declaration made to the senate and to the legislative
                        body in the session of the</hi> 20<hi rendition="#italic">th July,</hi>
                    1870.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Monsieurs:</hi> The statement which has been
                    presented to you in the session of the 15th has made the senate and the
                    legislative body acquainted with the just causes of war that we have against
                    Prussia. Conforming to the usual rules, and by the order of the Emperor, I
                    instructed the charge d’affaires of France to notify the cabinet of <pb
                        facs="0169" n="135" xml:id="pg135"/> Berlin of our resolution to prosecute
                    with arms the guarantees which we could not obtain by discussion. This course
                    has been adopted, and I have the honor to inform the senate and the legislative
                    body that in consequence of it war exists, since the 19th of July, between
                    France and Prussia.</p>
                <p>This declaration applies likewise to the allies of Prussia who aid her against us
                    with arms.</p>
            </div>
